Xiaomi will introduce a new software update at this year's Mobile World Congress (MWC) that will reportedly improve connectivity between its own devices and Apple products.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/02/xiaomi-hyper-os-3-1.jpeg" alt="" width="1200" height="675" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1037308" /><br/>
